      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Area Casting drawback</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you use one of your abilities to gain a temporary talent, if you are in the area chosen for your Area Casting drawback, you may gain one additional temporary talent from among those you could obtain.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc72\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
